{"id":"931bc3d500f82dff","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-immediate-consequence.md","title":"Immediate Consequence $T P$","display":"df-immediate-consequence — Immediate Consequence $T_P$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-immediate-consequence","aliases":["57-df-immediate-consequence"],"display":"df-immediate-consequence — Immediate Consequence $T_P$","depends_on":["[[57-df-definite-program]]","[[57-df-horn-clause]]","[[57-df-herbrand-base]]","[[57-df-ground-substitution]]","[[57-df-substitution-application]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-immediate-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-immediate-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-immediate-consequence — Immediate Consequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P\">\\(T_P\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"084b8299a8fe4c6c\" href=\"?note=084b8299a8fe4c6c\" title=\"57-df-ground-substitution\">57-df-ground-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a>；子句矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\">\\(A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a>。限定这些矩阵原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq B_S\">\\(I\\subseteq B_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\)</span>、原子代换和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"084b8299a8fe4c6c\" href=\"?note=084b8299a8fe4c6c\" title=\"57-df-ground-substitution\">57-df-ground-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})\\)</span> 是矩阵变量，不是闭合子句的空自由变量集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_P(I)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in B_S:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\;[&amp;D=A\\theta\\land A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\in P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(B_j\\theta\\in I)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_P(I)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in B_S:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\;[&amp;D=A\\theta\\land A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\in P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(B_j\\theta\\in I)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_P:\\mathcal P(B_S)\\to\\mathcal P(B_S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_P:\\mathcal P(B_S)\\to\\mathcal P(B_S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_P\\coloneqq B_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_P\\coloneqq B_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基代换只规定其已赋值变量取基项，不保证覆盖全部矩阵变量；覆盖条件必须另写。空体 n=0 的全部基事实直接进入结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-definite-program","status":"resolved","id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df