structure]]；$\\mathrm{lfp}$、$T_P^n$ 见 [[57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp]]。$M_P$ 是最小模型的真基原子集合，不把该集合与结构有序对混同。"},{"id":"22baba3a8d9c0ab5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$ 是固定字母表 $S$ 上的程序，每条子句的头与体原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；每条体有限，但 $P$ 不必有限。$B_P=B_S$、$T_P$ 取 [[57-df-immediate-consequence]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]\n[[57-df-equiv-left]]\n[[57-df-equiv-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-left]]\n[[57-df-existential-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-variable]]\n[[57-df-exists-left]]\n[[57-df-exists-right]]\n[[57-df-explicit-definability]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-field]]\n[[57-df-filter]]\n[[57-df-fin-deri